# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Google Identity Services)
# Dapatkan dari Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Buat OAuth 2.0 Client IDs -> Web application -> Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com

